## 📋 Overview

Bromar Hub is a full-stack web application that enables employees to submit weekly timesheets electronically. The system automatically validates submissions, stores data in a cloud database, and sends email notifications to management and employees.

### Key Features

- ✅ 7-day timesheet entry with validation
- ✅ Employee type-specific restrictions
- ✅ Call-out handling with 10-hour break warnings
- ✅ Travel time tracking (separate from normal/overtime)
- ✅ Auto-save functionality
- ✅ Dark/Light mode
- ✅ Automated email notifications
- ✅ Cloud database storage

