## 📊 Database Schema

### Supabase Table: `timesheets`

|Column                         |Type        |Description                             |
|-------------------------------|------------|----------------------------------------|
|`id`                           |UUID        |Primary key (auto-generated)            |
|`employee_name`                |TEXT        |Employee’s full name                    |
|`employee_email`               |TEXT        |Employee’s email address                |
|`employee_type`                |TEXT        |Electrician, Engineer, Apprentice, Other|
|`week_starting`                |DATE        |Monday of the week                      |
|`total_normal_hours`           |DECIMAL(5,2)|Sum of normal hours (excludes Travel)   |
|`total_overtime_hours`         |DECIMAL(5,2)|Sum of overtime hours                   |
|`total_travel_hours`           |DECIMAL(5,2)|Sum of travel hours                     |
|`total_hours`                  |DECIMAL(5,2)|Sum of all hours                        |
|`on_call_standby`              |BOOLEAN     |Employee was on call                    |
|`allowance_first_aid`          |BOOLEAN     |First Aid Officer allowance             |
|`allowance_construction_wiring`|BOOLEAN     |Construction Wiring allowance           |
|`general_comments`             |TEXT        |Additional comments                     |
|`timesheet_entries`            |JSONB       |Array of daily job entries              |
|`submitted_at`                 |TIMESTAMP   |Submission timestamp                    |

**Full schema:** See `FORM-INTEGRATION-GUIDE.md`

