## 📧 Email Configuration

### SendGrid Setup

**Recipients:** `servicet@bromar.com.au` + employee’s email  
**From:** `servicet@bromar.com.au`  
**Reply-To:** `admin@bromar.com.au`  
**Method:** Inline HTML (no template ID)

### Email Verification

**Option 1: Single Sender Verification** (Quick - 5 minutes)

1. SendGrid → Settings → Sender Authentication
1. Verify Single Sender → `servicet@bromar.com.au`
1. Check email and click verification link

**Option 2: Domain Authentication** (Recommended - 1-2 days)

1. SendGrid → Settings → Sender Authentication
1. Authenticate Your Domain → `bromar.com.au`
1. Add 3 CNAME DNS records provided by SendGrid
1. Wait 24-48 hours for DNS propagation
1. Click Verify

