## 🔐 Authentication

Bromar Hub uses **Supabase Authentication** to protect pages.

### How It Works

1. User visits any protected page
1. `auth.js` checks for active session
1. If no session → Redirect to `/index.html` (login)
1. If session exists → Allow access

### Protected Pages

All pages in `/job-management/` require authentication.

### Adding Auth to New Pages

```html
<!-- Add before closing </body> -->
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2"></script>
<script src="../js/auth.js"></script>
```

**See:** `js/auth.js` for implementation details

