## ✅ Business Rules

### Validation

- All 5 weekdays (Mon-Fri) must have hours entered
- Total normal hours must equal 40 per week (Travel excluded)
- Time increments: 0.25 hours (15 minutes)

### Employee Type Restrictions

|Employee Type  |Hidden Options                 |Special Features                                      |
|---------------|-------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------|
|**Electrician**|TIL (Taken), Trade School      |Construction Wiring allowance                         |
|**Engineer**   |RDO                            |TIL (Taken) available, Overtime labeled “Time in Lieu”|
|**Apprentice** |TIL (Taken), Long Service Leave|Trade School available                                |
|**Other**      |None                           |All options available                                 |

### Special Job Types

- **Call Out:** Overtime only, auto-fills 4 hours, triggers 10-hour break warning
- **Travel (outside 50km):** Separate field, excluded from 40-hour count
- **Leave Types:** Auto-fill 8 hours (RDO, Annual Leave, Sick Leave, etc.)

