## 🐛 Troubleshooting

|Issue                       |Solution                                                                   |
|----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|“Failed to submit timesheet”|Check Netlify function logs, verify environment variables                  |
|Email not received          |Verify `SENDGRID_API_KEY` starts with “SG.”, check sender verification     |
|Data not in Supabase        |Verify using **service_role** key (NOT anon key)                           |
|Dependencies error          |Ensure `package.json` in root, `netlify.toml` has `command = "npm install"`|
|Only Monday data in email   |Verify function parses `job-{dayIndex}-{jobIndex}_type` pattern            |

